.TH SEARCH2MD 1 "September 2026" "search2md 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
search2md \- search the web and convert pages to Markdown
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B search2md
.I COMMAND
.RI [ OPTIONS ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B search2md
queries web search providers and converts result pages or arbitrary URLs to
clean Markdown. Results may be cached for a later conversion step.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B search
Search configured providers and cache the result list.
.TP
.B md
Convert a cached result or URL to Markdown.
.TP
.B serve
Run the HTTP service.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \ -h, --help
Display command help.
.TP
.B -V, --version
Display version information.
.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
.EX
search2md search "Debian packaging" --limit 5
search2md md 1 --stdout
.EE
.SH SEE ALSO
Project documentation: https://github.com/automataIA/search2md
